#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/innawood/player/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You have no idea what happened, but you're alone in the unspoiled wilderness."
"  You have mud on your feet, none of your clothes or possessions, and you "
"don't know where you are.  But you have learned there's a beast inside you, "
"and anyone who crosses you had best beware."
msgstr ""

