#. ~ Description of monster "Vampiric Anathema"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/anathema.json
msgid ""
"Your instincts are telling you three things about this armored, axe-wielding "
"humanoid foe: they are a vampire far more powerful than you, they thirst for "
"your blood, and they are a vampire hunter wanting all vampires dead.  You "
"know for certain that you will be quickly killed if you attack them without a"
" proper plan."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "Vampiric Anathema"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/anathema.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's wounds are closing at a rapid pace!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "Vampiric Anathema"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/anathema.json
