#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/anathema.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%1$s accelerates to the point your eyes struggle to follow and heal their "
"wounds as shadows surround their body!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Message in effect in EoC "EOC_ANATHEMA_CHECK_FOR_START" in nested EOCs in
#. effect in EoC "EOC_ANATHEMA_BUFF_ON_HIT"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/anathema.json
