#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/anathema.json
msgid ""
"The vampiric anathema accelerates to the point your eyes struggle to follow "
"and heal their wounds as shadows surround their body!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_ANATHEMA_SPAWN_MESSAGE"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/anathema.json
