"You feel a threat closing in, more dangerous than anything you've ever faced.  Your vampiric instincts urge you to flee, as fighting them is certain to cause your death.\n"
"RUN."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_ANATHEMA_WITHDRAWS_FOR_NOW"
